    'Personalises this section and your journal exports. Optional — skip any time; add it later from here or Settings.': 'ປັບສ່ວນນີ້ ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກບັນທຶກຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ. ເປັນທາງເລືອກ — ຂ້າມໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ແລະ ເພີ່ມພາຍຫຼັງໄດ້ຈາກທີ່ນີ້ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.',
    'Downloads each language’s pronunciations from an online voice once, so the phrasebook’s speaker then works with no signal. There is one audio quality — the online voice does not offer a choice. Lao has no online voice to download from at all yet (tracked separately); this app’s other phrasebook languages already have a voice built into most phones, so a downloaded pack would not buy them anything.': 'ດາວໂຫຼດການອອກສຽງຂອງແຕ່ລະພາສາຈາກສຽງອອນລາຍຄັ້ງດຽວ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລຳໂພງຂອງຄູ່ມືປະໂຍກໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີສັນຍານ.',
